{"id":"n68004-1-7","stage":5,"title":"오붓하다 · 和睦","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n68004-1-7-1","ko":"너 남자 친구랑 정말 오붓해 보이던데?","zh":"你看起来和男朋友关系真好啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"남자","meaning":"男性（남자 친구 合指“男朋友”）","explanation":"남자：男性（남자 친구 合指“男朋友”）","readings":[{"term":"남자","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60865","senseId":"3","lemma":"남자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남자","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3"}},{"text":"친구랑","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구랑","audio":"/audio/74f6c9e10aa7a90f70e1.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"오붓해","meaning":"和睦","explanation":"오붓하다：和睦；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"오붓하다","audio":"/audio/91493c043585fffb0254.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68004","senseId":"1","lemma":"오붓하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오붓해","audio":"/audio/7e74bf9b535fce436abe.mp3"}},{"text":"보이던데?","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；던데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","sen