c17e2997aa8d","term":"번","zh":"次，遍","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3","entryId":"26846","definition":"计算事情次数的数量单位。","pronunciation":["번"]},{"id":"e27f0e273d4af17d","term":"싸우다","zh":"打架，争斗","audio":"/audio/e27f0e273d4af17d7ed1.mp3","entryId":"29732","definition":"想要获胜而用语言或力气等进行较量。","pronunciation":["싸우다"]},{"id":"137f8ca799a58274","term":"적","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/137f8ca799a5827448b3.mp3","entryId":"71232","definition":"进行某事或出现其状态的时候；或过去某个时间。","pronunciation":["적"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不发生某个事情或症状。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/ebee6c9d0d0d02d62f90.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.757,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=68004","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":163,"sequenceScore":3.2337,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，我们从来没吵过架呢。","你看起来和男朋友关系真好啊？","那位原本好好的人，怎么突然生病了。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你看起来和男朋友关系真好啊？","那位原本好好的人，怎么突然生病了。","嗯，我们从来没吵过架呢。"],"answer":2}]}
